# Scopes `gcloud run deploy --source .` (repo root) to exactly what the root
# Dockerfile uses: Dockerfile, app/ and prompts/. Allowlist, not denylist —
# corrected 2026-11-27 after finding that the denylist version let the root
# `.env` (local secrets) into every uploaded source archive since 2026-08-17
# and the root `.venv/` (~250 MB) into the 2026-11-27 one. Anything new at
# the repo root is now excluded by default.
/*
!/Dockerfile
!/app/
!/prompts/

# Inside app/: never local secrets, virtualenvs or caches.
app/.env
app/.env.*
app/.venv*/
app/**/__pycache__/
app/.pytest_cache/
app/.mypy_cache/
app/.ruff_cache/
